1
00:00:00,260 --> 00:00:02,060
(Leonard:)Penny kissing me is not insane.

2
00:00:02,060 --> 00:00:03,900
(Leonard:)She used to kiss me
all the time.

3
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:06,830
(Sheldon:)Einstein defined insanity
as "doing the same thing

4
00:00:06,830 --> 00:00:10,200
(Sheldon:)over and over again and
expecting different results."

5
00:00:10,740 --> 00:00:11,770
(Sheldon:)By that standard,

6
00:00:11,770 --> 00:00:13,940
(Sheldon:)Penny is cuckoo for Cocoa Puffs.

7
00:00:14,910 --> 00:00:16,560
(Leonard:)I'm just saying,

8
00:00:16,560 --> 00:00:18,560
(Leonard:)it felt like it may have
meant something.

9
00:00:18,560 --> 00:00:20,350
(Howard:)Ah, this takes me back.

10
00:00:20,350 --> 00:00:21,810
(Howard:)Leonard obsessing about Penny.

11
00:00:21,810 --> 00:00:24,550
(Howard:)I mean, don't get me wrong,
I love your new stuff,

12
00:00:24,550 --> 00:00:27,150
(Howard:)but once in a while
it's nice to hear the hits.

13
00:00:27,150 --> 00:00:28,390
(Raj:)Ooh, ooh!

14
00:00:28,390 --> 00:00:32,260
Do "Our babies will be smart
and beautiful."

15
00:00:33,590 --> 00:00:36,440
(Raj:)That one always makes me laugh.

16
00:00:38,660 --> 00:00:40,530
(Leonard:)Why do I bother
talking to you people?

17
00:00:40,530 --> 00:00:42,770
(Sheldon:)If it'll make you feel better,
we rarely listen.

18
00:00:42,770 --> 00:00:45,340
(Penny(at door):)Hey, can I talk to you
out here for a sec?

19
00:00:45,340 --> 00:00:46,600
(Leonard:)Yeah, sure.

20
00:00:48,110 --> 00:00:51,410
(Sheldon:)I'm starting to think we're
never going to see that pizza.

21
00:00:52,510 --> 00:00:54,960
(Penny:)So you're probably wondering
what that was all about.

22
00:00:54,960 --> 00:00:56,980
(Leonard:)What, uh, the kissing
and everything?

23
00:00:56,980 --> 00:01:00,440
(Leonard:)Nah, women do that to me
all the time.

